{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55796","headline":"题河阴崔少府素幛 · 翁承赞","name":"题河阴崔少府素幛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真玉不显文，至人不逞迹。\n君见华堂幛，转觉虚室白。\n旷然绝氛滓，润色惟粉泽。\n皎若朗月昇，皓如繁霜积。\n清晨卷帘望，秋天横半壁。\n昼景当户闚，晴云拂瑶席。\n非无丹青妙，点污吾所惜。\n世事巧乱真，我将世情隔。\n自持纯素质，可悦神仙客。\n何必玩画屏，留连假泉石。\n（同前第一三八九页。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁承赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55796.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55796","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}